WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.280
As enterprises continue to look for new ways to innovate,

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:05.940
unlock the power of their data,

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.840
and create personalized customer experiences,

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.000
integration has become an obstacle to success.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.360
Traditional approaches to integration simply can't keep up.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:20.120
Organizations need to increase the speed of integration while lowering the cost.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.420
To do this, a modern approach to integration is needed.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:26.180
By adopting an agile integration strategy,

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.780
paired with IBM Cloud Pak for Integration,

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:31.020
you can support the scale, security,

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:34.900
and flexibility, required to power your digital transformation.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.880
IBM Cloud Pak for Integration

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:41.260
can be deployed on premises or on any public or private cloud environment

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.280
by leveraging Red Hat OpenShift,

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:46.460
allowing your team to innovate and scale in a sandbox

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:49.220
without putting your existing infrastructure at risk.

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:55.240
Learn, innovate, and scale at your own pace while continuing leverage your existing investments.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:01:00.620
IBM Cloud Pak for Integration leverages the right mix of integration capabilities

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.120
to balance traditional and modern integration styles.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:07.140
Simplify the management of your integration architecture

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:09.360
and integrate 3 times faster,

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:13.300
while reducing the cost of integration by one third.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:17.140
Let's start by logging into IBM Cloud Pak for Integration.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:24.720
As you can see, a single login provides you with access to all of  the integration tools your team needs in one unified experience.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:27.540
In the sidebar are all of the capabilities.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.760
Let's take a quick look at each.

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:32.200
We'll start with API lifecycle,

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:39.240
which allows you to create, secure, manage, share, and monetize API's across all of your cloud environments

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:41.480
using the built-in developer portal.

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:46.940
A robust API strategy is a key component
to any modern integration strategy.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:51.220
Take control of your API ecosystem and scale integration.

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:54.440
The next capability is application integration.

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:57.580
From the simplest Software as a Solution application,

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:00.040
to the most complex on-premises systems,

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:03.320
your team can use a  broad range of pre-built connectors

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:10.020
to quickly integrate data and applications  without worrying about mismatched sources formats or standards.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:15.180
Our enterprise messaging capability is a security-rich messaging solution,

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:18.764
developed through our years of
experience with IBM MQ,

00:02:18.764 --> 00:02:22.000
trusted by some of the world's most successful enterprises.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.040
Simplify and facilitate the exchange of data

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.420
while ensuring that each message is sent and received only once.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:33.860
No modern hybrid integration platform is complete without event streaming,

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:39.080
which uses Apache Kafka to allow you to not only send messages easily and reliably,

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.560
but also to react to events in real time,

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:45.520
enabling you to provide your customers with more personalized experiences.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:48.800
Our high-speed data transfer is truly unique.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:53.420
Send, share, stream, and sync large data sets virtually anywhere,

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:57.580
reliably and at maximum speed across global IP networks.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:01.920
Accelerate collaboration and meet the
demands of complex global teams

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:04.960
without compromising performance or security.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:08.660
The secure gateway found in IBM Cloud Pak for Integration

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:12.240
provides organizations with a single multi-channel gateway

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:16.240
to meet the security and integration needs of today's digital business.

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:22.120
While being able to access all of the integration styles your team needs from a single interface is great,

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:26.040
there are also some additional benefits to this unified experience,

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:30.030
including common logging and an asset repository.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:34.000
the common logging feature found in IBM Cloud Pak for Integration

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:39.200
allows you to search and visualize log entries across your entire integration environment.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.242
You can find logging links for every individual instance

00:03:42.242 --> 00:03:45.160
in both the header and instance lists.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:50.400
These links launch Kibana with predefined filters for each capability.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:53.720
The asset repository is a centralized hub,

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:57.980
allowing teams on IBM Cloud Pak for Integration to work collaboratively

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.140
- sharing and reusing resources

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:03.080
to save time and improve efficiency.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:07.640
While we've briefly touched on some of the most important features and capabilities

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.760
of IBM Cloud Pak for Integration,

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.360
the value really becomes clear

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:15.240
when you see the power of using some of these capabilities together.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:20.280
The improvements in your team's work flow and efficiency through IBM Cloud Pak for Integration,

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:23.714
combined with the benefits of an agile
integration strategy,

00:04:23.714 --> 00:04:28.240
will enable your business to support a modern, agile approach to integration

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:31.580
and keep up with the increasing demand for integration.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.200
Thank you for watching.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:38.540
Take the next step on your cloud journey by visiting our website.

